<title>ESTONIA: RAKVERE INVESTIGATION MAY TAKE MONTHS.</title>
<headline>RAKVERE INVESTIGATION MAY TAKE MONTHS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The securities commission said on Wednesday that an investigation into alleged insider trading in Rakvere meat factory shares may take several months.</p>
<p>&quot;An investigation usually takes two months but it is our best estimate,&quot; commission deputy director Indrek Jakobson told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;The police have to make clear if there was a crime...or any other violation of the law,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>The bourse on Wednesday suspended trade in Rakvere shares after the securities commission said the police have initiated criminal charges for alleged insider dealing.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
